<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard contained a 2,000‑liter mineral oil leak from a submarine cable off Tabango, Leyte, while Japan pledged $27 million for coastal radar and drones to boost Philippine surveillance. China Coast Guard vessels continued patrolling waters around the disputed Diaoyu Dao and a Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal, prompting the Philippines to summon the Chinese ambassador over remarks it deemed threatening. Manila also sought additional Indian BrahMos missiles to strengthen its coastal defenses against China. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxORGhaeDV4NnFpQkUzdnEwU1RSck8tYjE5NHhhMGV1UFo4cG1RVWtBMy1OSl8ybmhDUTJtd1lpQXdpaTdSTktEcl8tVEgtTVBLRDNDMHJqUTdqNmdxSWxwQ00tQTlQMGF2TUIzcWJ4LWxocUJUeE9VQW5pTEJtVm1KckFwYU1wWUF1cmw3bXdDbW1tTlU1WUl2eEZZRmxyZy1aMFAzamNTNGl0dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;TimesLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNSXV6cW93dHRSbG9UbVJ3RmtFaVdpY1V4ZnVSMWVHRkh1dnNrdnJxdnhNWW50Nzd5ajVETGliTnlvaUpOMTl4ZnZvUWxmX2VZQXVaNzlUN01hdlZTQkxIdnlPZ3E5bE96elhRUjNpaHVRNzNqbS13U09vekFuNmRYM20zTWJCV2tIcDZlejVwZjdQeXJFVFJFdFp4N0EyUUx1X2tqNzg5cjFlUEVxMVI0TndJR1ZZaGxY?oc=5&quot;&gt;MLQ.ai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOS0FvbUl0R0xFQ3VBQ0dsY3FWRXZCdHpJTmNtSnNuWnBSS0VONm1kUkFCY29uckcwYld0b28wYjB0d0JPbWY2QjRDWV9JeDRWSXpFY25mVEs5X1p6Y0FjTGRpS2h4VFU0UGtQd2p2SExhREQwUW8wUEM1czhKcE1Eb2lqYk5VUmpSYXQ5MlM4MTNUR29GaHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Japan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/artic